  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS 2021, JakartaEM, Yayasan Ayo Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This funding will will support a twelve-month programme aimed at improving the lives of people living with disabilities (PLDs) in one of Indonesia&#x2019;s poorest, and least resourced provinces. This will be achieved through various intervention: proper disability-focused data collection; involving PLDs in the development of local plans; training of local medical staff on disability care; attracting proper attention from the policy making structure at village and district level through information seminars.</narrative>
  </description>
